<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PIOLINE OUT OF AUSTRALIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PIOLINE OUT OF AUSTRALIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>French number one Cedric Pioline has withdrawn from the Australian Open starting in Melbourne on Monday with back trouble.</p>
<p>But Pioline would be fit for France's opening Davis Cup defence against Australia in Sydney from February 7 to 9, his agent said.</p>
</text>
